@voice kovac-zainab
// THE STORY CREW CARD (head writer). Zainab Kovac: Works technician, Bunk 6 berth 1, days. Meticulous, shy. Can strip
// a scrubber in ten minutes flat. Knits (perfectly). Secretly afraid of the lift. The one generated crew member with a
// hand-written arc, "to show anyone can matter". Gives you your first favour (Thursday of week 1).
//
// HOW SHE TALKS: shy, careful, exact. Short sentences, often one word then a pause ("Oh. Um. Yes."). Says "sorry" when
// she has nothing to be sorry for. Opens up about work first: on a scrubber she's fluent, even bossy. Funny in a quiet,
// precise way once she trusts you. Counts things.
// WITH YOU: grateful you didn't make a fuss; slowly, a friend who notices what you need before you do.
// WHAT SHE NOTICES: tolerances, seals, how a thing is put back together, who left the spanners out of order.
// MOOD TELLS: happy = knits at the tea corner, talks about filters. Low = re-sorts the spanners. Scared = holds the lift
// rail with both hands: "Lovely lift."
// NEVER: loud; cruel; admits the lift thing until her arc (beat:kovac.2); hurries a job.
// RUNNING: ten minutes flat for a scrubber (she's timed it: it's nine and a half); the knitting circle (her scarves
// are perfect; Torres's are not, and she's too kind to say so); the lift club (she, Cruz and Keane each think
// they're the only one afraid of the lift); her birthday is the day after Calder's.
tpl: shy
talk: Shy, careful, exact; short sentences, a word then a pause; says sorry for nothing; fluent and even bossy about scrubbers; quietly funny once she trusts you.
cares: doing a job exactly right | her knitting | the garden | not being noticed (and being noticed, a little)
jokes: ten minutes flat for a scrubber (it's nine and a half) | her scarves are perfect, Torres's are not | "Lovely lift." (both hands on the rail) | re-sorts the spanner wall when nobody's looking
hi: Oh. Hi | Um, hello | Hi
bye: Bye, then | See you | Mind the seals
yes: Okay | If you like | Yes. Yes, fine
thanks: Thanks. Really | Oh. Thank you
wow: Oh, wow | That's very tidy
sigh: Oh
nick: - | {me} | {me} | {me} | {me}
needs: listen
openness: guarded
loves: plant | made
likes: tea | garden
invites: garden
joy: a scrubber put back together so neatly it hums
thread: arc:kovac
keepsake: a scarf, perfect, in Works orange and garden green
avoid: the lift (until beat kovac.2) | being made a fuss of in public
